  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_HEADER.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_OVERVIEW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我們讓跨平台設定變得輕鬆簡單！</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">在 Forge 平台上，我們採用官方設定系統來實現熱重載功能。</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">而在 Fabric 上，由於他們沒有提供相關系統，我們改用 JSONC。</span></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">自 1.20 版本起，我們已停用 Forge 的官方系統，因為該系統相當容易出錯。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我們也提供了一個很酷的直覺介面，讓大家能輕鬆上手，免去繁瑣的手動設定。</span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/gwudTd.png\" alt=\"這份設定已經是最頂的配置了！\" width=\"2246\" height=\"1400\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"227\"></a></p>",
